    MC "什么计划？"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:560
translate schinese main18freetimechloe_6381612f:

    # v "Hmm... I haven't decided between math or generalized magical studies like yourself."
    v "嗯……我还没决定是学数学，还是像你一样学广义的魔法研究。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:561
translate schinese main18freetimechloe_503878f5:

    # v "Rockwell isn't the highest for mathematics, but if I pursue magic, we could spend even more time together, [name]! How wonderful!"
    v "洛克威尔的数学排名并不高，但如果我去学魔法，我们就能花更多时间在一起，[name]！多棒啊！"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:562
translate schinese main18freetimechloe_dfc26975:

    # v "I'm sure you're just dying to show me around."
    v "你肯定已经迫不及待想带我四处看看了吧。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:563
translate schinese main18freetimechloe_0bc01e6b:

    # v "...What's the matter, Chloe? You're not pouting nearly as much as I expected you to."
    v "……怎么了，克洛伊？你撅嘴的程度比我预想的少多了。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:564
translate schinese main18freetimechloe_741ab174:

    # v "Could it be? You've finally adapted?"
    v "难道是……你终于适应了？"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:565
translate schinese main18freetimechloe_e3ab1f08:

    # c "And if I have? Are you gonna move on to someone else?"
    c "如果我适应了？你就要去找别人了吗？"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:566
translate schinese main18freetimechloe_3cf7dd30:

    # v "I already tried with [name], and he deflects every blow with ease. I'm not long for this way of life any longer."
    v "我已经试过和[name]在一起了，他每次都能轻松挡开我的攻击。我已经受够了这种生活。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:567
translate schinese main18freetimechloe_9669cff2:

    # MC "I'm sure Chloe has uses outside of being a verbal punching bag."
    MC "我相信克洛伊除了当人肉出气筒，还有别的用途。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:568
translate schinese main18freetimechloe_714c3ae3:

    # v "You speak as if you don't know those other uses."
    v "你说得好像完全不知道那些用途似的。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:569
translate schinese main18freetimechloe_ed07f149:

    # v "She's an utterly fantastic cushion. It's the only reason I'm here right now, my favorite cushion is currently undergoing detergent-based renovations."
    v "她是个极其棒的抱枕。我现在来这里就是因为这个——我最喜欢的抱枕正在接受洗涤剂改造。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:570
translate schinese main18freetimechloe_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:571
translate schinese main18freetimechloe_e58d3449:

    # MC "Chloe, do you want to go to the beach?"
    MC "克洛伊，你想去海滩吗？"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:572
translate schinese main18freetimechloe_d4d122f5:

    # c "Eh? Now?"
    c "欸？现在？"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:573
translate schinese main18freetimechloe_a99f00b8:

    # MC "No."
    MC "不。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:574
translate schinese main18freetimechloe_c0234c75:

    # c "Uh... then... okay... who's going?"
    c "呃……那……好吧……谁要去？"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:576
translate schinese main18freetimechloe_9723a5eb:

    # MC "All of us... I think... I haven't asked everyone yet. Cadence is up for it. Actually it was her idea."
    MC "大家……我想……我还没问过所有人。凯登丝愿意去。其实还是她先提的。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:578
translate schinese main18freetimechloe_9a26cd73:

    # MC "All of us... I think... I haven't asked everyone yet. Cadence is up for it."
    MC "大家……我想……我还没问过所有人。凯登丝愿意去。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:579
translate schinese main18freetimechloe_81eb6251:

    # v "Uh oh, I need to pretend I didn't hear that invitation so you don't feel guilt-tripped into extending it towards me."
    v "糟糕，我得假装没听见那个邀请，免得你觉得我是出于愧疚才被邀请的。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:580
translate schinese main18freetimechloe_d9ebec3f:

    # MC "*Sigh*"
    MC "*叹气*"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:581
translate schinese main18freetimechloe_271c2b59:

    # MC "Vineeta, you're free to come."
    MC "维妮塔，你也可以来。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:582
translate schinese main18freetimechloe_01be2f63:

    # v "Oh, and here I was planning to conveniently go on the same day."
    v "哦，我本来还打算刚好同一天去的。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:583
translate schinese main18freetimechloe_d3a049ba:

    # v "I'll decide once you've actually finalized a date. Don't let it hinge on me, I'm totally fine with missing out."
    v "等你真的定下日期再说。别因为我改变计划，错过这次活动我完全没关系。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:584
translate schinese main18freetimechloe_585a524d:

    # MC "Looking forward to it."
    MC "我很期待。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:597
translate schinese main18freetimegrace_4b340443:

    # g "..."
    g "……"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:600
translate schinese main18freetimegrace_e3e3f839:

    # MC "What's going on here? This doesn't look like a pool..."
    MC "这里怎么回事？看起来不像泳池……"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:601
translate schinese main18freetimegrace_cf69329a:

    # g "I'm evening out those tan lines so they actually conform to my swimsuit."
    g "我在把晒痕修匀，让它们符合我的泳衣线条。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:602
translate schinese main18freetimegrace_9c42f44e:

    # MC "Hmm... they followed your running gear before, didn't they?"
    MC "嗯……它们以前也一直跟着你的跑步装备吧？"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:603
translate schinese main18freetimegrace_a7def71f:

    # g "You would remember that, wouldn't you? I see the way you glare at me."
    g "你肯定会记得的，对吧？我都看见你瞪我的眼神了。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:604
translate schinese main18freetimegrace_3505a27b:

    # MC "My eyes are more glued to your body than clothes tend to."
    MC "我的眼睛更多是黏在你的身体上，而不是衣服上。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:605
translate schinese main18freetimegrace_e34ebbff:

    # g "And yet you can't stop staring. I would've thought a person could adapt after all this time."
    g "可你还是停不下来盯着看。我还以为过了这么久，人总能适应。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:606
translate schinese main18freetimegrace_30f37f43:

    # MC "I'm sure if the roles were reversed you'd be giving me those binocular AWOOGA eyes every day."
    MC "要是角色互换，我敢说你每天都会用那双望远镜一样的“哇哦”眼睛看我。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:607
translate schinese main18freetimegrace_a4f79ca0:

    # MC "You're lucky if you even get to see me shirtless."
    MC "你能看到我光着身子就该偷着乐了。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:608
translate schinese main18freetimegrace_c0fc2354:

    # g "You're {i}not{/i} shirtless?"
    g "你{i}没{/i}穿衣服？"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:609
translate schinese main18freetimegrace_83c7856a:

    # MC "???"
    MC "？？？"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:610
translate schinese main18freetimegrace_5763af5d:

    # g "Oh, well I always thought that pasty white chest of yours was just your own tan lines..."
    g "哦，我一直以为你那双苍白得像面团的胸口只是晒痕……"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:611
translate schinese main18freetimegrace_b8060ee1:

    # g "You're telling me you wear that shirt every day?"
    g "你是说你每天都穿那件衬衫？"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:612
translate schinese main18freetimegrace_94c811d1:

    # MC "Nuh-uh, I cycle through several shirts throughout the week, thank you very much."
    MC "才不是，我一周会换好几件衬衫，谢谢你关心。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:613
translate schinese main18freetimegrace_5b6fb653:

    # MC "If you actually cared about me, you'd notice."
    MC "如果你真的在乎我，早就会注意到了。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:614
translate schinese main18freetimegrace_c5b25a26:

    # g "Mmhm. And what distinguishes these shirts from one-another?"
    g "嗯哼。那这些衬衫之间有什么区别？"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:615
translate schinese main18freetimegrace_61c1d287:

    # MC "The hanger I put them on."
    MC "我挂在衣架上的位置不同。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:616
translate schinese main18freetimegrace_8e1964e3:

    # g "Yeah, I can't tell which is which."
    g "对，我分不出哪件是哪件。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:617
translate schinese main18freetimegrace_61b7b93d:

    # MC "I thought you were my biggest fan! I'm disappointed..."
    MC "我还以为你是我最大的粉丝呢！真让人失望……"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:618
translate schinese main18freetimegrace_76103ae1:

    # g "I {i}am{/i} your biggest fan, for what achievement is being the tallest mountain on a flat plane?"
    g "我{i}就是{/i}你最大的粉丝，毕竟在平地上当最高的山也算一种成就吧？"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:619
translate schinese main18freetimegrace_a8b3b583:

    # MC "You'd be my favorite mountain."
    MC "你会是我最喜欢的山。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:620
translate schinese main18freetimegrace_6cd3b803:

    # g "Aww... well isn't that sweet? I'm your favorite mountain."
    g "啊……这话说得真甜？我是你最喜欢的山。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:621
translate schinese main18freetimegrace_c3ecb703:

    # MC "You're my favorite red-headed swimmer friend too."
    MC "你也是我最喜欢的红发游泳朋友。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:622
translate schinese main18freetimegrace_4fa4c708:

    # g "Would you hold that opinion if Noelle donned the swimsuit?"
    g "如果诺艾尔穿上这套泳衣，你还会这么想吗？"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:623
translate schinese main18freetimegrace_65f71e14:

    # MC "Oh no! Don't pit me in a hypothetical battle between the redheads!"
    MC "不！别把我放进两个红发之间的假想战斗里！"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:624
translate schinese main18freetimegrace_3499fc2f:

    # g "My head's far redder than Noelle's. Maybe she got a more generous helping of mom's genes."
    g "我的头可比诺艾尔红多了。也许她从我妈妈那里得到的基因更多。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:625
translate schinese main18freetimegrace_df6d8b48:

    # MC "Have we tested Miya's muscle density?"
    MC "我们测试过米娅的肌肉密度吗？"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:626
translate schinese main18freetimegrace_7dfefd0b:

    # g "I don't even think dad was built like me, I'm clearly an undiscovered superhero."
    g "我爸都没我这么壮，我显然是个还没被发现的超级英雄。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:627
translate schinese main18freetimegrace_a56f030a:

    # MC "You know, sometimes I believe it."
    MC "你知道吗，有时候我还真信。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:640
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_317efe5c:

    # C "*Yawn* Master..."
    C "*哈欠* 主人……"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:643
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_f1b035c2:

    # MC "What's with the yawning?"
    MC "怎么打哈欠了？"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:644
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_e0633d76:

    # C "*Yawn* Sorry, master, I'm not fully awake yet..."
    C "*哈欠* 对不起，主人，我还没完全醒……"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:645
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_372092a2:

    # MC "\"Yet\"? You've been asleep all day?"
    MC "还没？你睡了一整天？"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:646
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_33295c99:

    # C "Mmm... no. I just came out of a little cat-nap is all..."
    C "嗯……没有。我只是小睡了一下……"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:647
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_f8954330:

    # MC "Cat-nap..."
    MC "小睡……"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:648
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_b11b4816:

    # C "Ugh..."
    C "呃……"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:649
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_0f7c4651:

    # MC "You really call it that?"
    MC "你还真这么叫？"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:650
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_38d3d373:

    # C "I don't want to hear it."
    C "我不想听。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:651
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_8f5f4aec:

    # C "Yes, I had a... cat-nap... and then I had a human-shower."
    C "对，我睡了个……猫觉……然后又洗了个人类澡。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:652
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_8f0eef54:

    # MC "*Sniff* Is that..."
    MC "*吸鼻子* 那是……"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:653
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_866d418a:

    # MC "*Sniff*"
    MC "*吸鼻子*"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:654
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_44951e71:

    # MC "Is that {i}my{/i} shower gel?"
    MC "那是{i}我的{/i}沐浴露？"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:655
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_e7b7ae75:

    # C "Ah... sorry... I should've asked..."
    C "啊……对不起……我应该先问你的……"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:656
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_5371607d:

    # MC "Uh... I mean, I guess it's fine. I've gotta be using the cheapest. You know how men are."
    MC "呃……我是说，其实也没事。我用的肯定是最便宜的。你也知道男人就是这样。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:657
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_b565e7a9:

    # MC "Women will have like, twelve different products in the shower with flavors such as \"River Passion\", and \"Lotus caress\", and it \"Revitalizes roots\" or \"Energizes and reverses skin aging\"."
    MC "女人浴室里会有十几种产品，什么“河流激情”“莲花抚触”，还会写上“修护根部”或“焕发活力、逆龄嫩肤”。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:658
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_1228ee48:

    # MC "And us dudes will get like a bottle of five-in-one, it'll be sandalwood flavor, and it \"makes your balls smell nice\"."
    MC "而我们男人只会拿一瓶五合一的，檀香味的，还写着“让你的蛋蛋闻起来很香”。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:659
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_a5f5bd08:

    # MC "It's cool but... why are you using my stuff anyway?"
    MC "倒也没事，不过……你为什么用我的东西？"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:660
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_393f72fb:

    # "You see a feint hint of redness wash over her cheeks."
    "你看见她的脸颊上浮现出一抹淡淡的红晕。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:661
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_4543adfa:

    # C "The uh... the um... my nose!"
    C "那、那个……呃……我的鼻子！"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:662
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_66631d00:

    # C "All of the other soaps were uh... giving me a headache! So I switched to yours!"
    C "其他肥皂都会让我头疼！所以我换成你的了！"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:663
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_9c84dba2:

    # C "I smell everything a little differently from you guys so uh... yeah, y'know... I need to be a little picky..."
    C "我闻东西的点和你们不太一样，所以……嗯，你懂的……我得挑剔一点……"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:664
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_29aff3a6:

    # MC "Uh-huh, well. You can keep using my stuff, that's fine."
    MC "嗯，好吧。你继续用我的东西也没关系。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:665
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_0bd8f31a:

    # C "Thank you, master. You're always so understanding."
    C "谢谢你，主人。你总是这么通情达理。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:666
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_4ff34631:

    # MC "Not at all. I don't understand why if pee comes from the penis, why doesn't poo come from the poonis?"
    MC "才不是。我不明白，为什么尿是从阴茎出来的，便便却不是从“小便穴”出来的？"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:667
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_26a803bc:

    # C "..."
    C "……"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:668
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_b48d9d3c:

    # C "Is it too late to rescind the binding? I don't want you as my master anymore."
    C "现在解除主从契约还来得及吗？我不要再认你当主人了。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:669
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_f306978e:

    # C "I don't even know if I can look at your face after such an atrocious joke."
    C "听到这么可怕的玩笑之后，我都不知道自己还能不能看着你的脸。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:670
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_0de57fbd:

    # MC "I thought my marine biologist slave would have answers for such physiological matters."
    MC "我还以为我的海洋生物学家奴隶能回答这种生理学问题。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:671
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_135f0fb2:

    # C "I never became a fully-fledged marine biologist, master. And even if I did, I doubt they'd teach me how to entertain abysmal attempts at humor."
    C "我毕竟没有成为真正的海洋生物学家，主人。就算我成了，我也怀疑他们会不会教我怎么欣赏这种灾难级的冷笑话。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:672
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_0a795c19:

    # MC "Why marine biology anyway? Why not medicine, entomology, zoology?"
    MC "为什么是海洋生物学？而不是医学、昆虫学、动物学？"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:673
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_aafa2a3d:

    # C "I think it's unbelievable the things you can find in the ocean. The diversity is off of the charts, not to mention that the waters contain the least explored biomes on the planet."
    C "我觉得海洋里的东西简直不可思议。多样性高得离谱，更别说海水里还生活着地球上最少有人探索的生物群系。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:674
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_715f0d0b:

    # C "That little reef I mentioned wasn't even the tip of the iceberg. It's more like an atom on top of the tip of the iceberg."
    C "我刚才提到的那片小珊瑚礁，甚至都不是冰山的一角。更像是冰山一角上的一个原子。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:675
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_dc880965:

    # C "Are you still taking me to the beach?"
    C "你还要带我去海滩吗？"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:676
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_802b08ef:

    # MC "Plan Beach is still in the works, don't worry about it. Gotta find a time it works for everyone, and we're golden."
    MC "海滩计划还在筹备中，别担心。得找个大家都合适的时间，然后就没问题了。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:677
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_b75caad7:

    # C "I guess I'll need something to wear."
    C "我想我得找点衣服穿。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:678
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_d2f85aaa:

    # MC "Can you swim?"
    MC "你会游泳吗？"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:679
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_4668c268:

    # C "I can. I can hold my breath for a long time too."
    C "会。我还能憋气很久。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:680
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_f1c0dc1d:

    # MC "I am aware."
    MC "我知道。"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:681
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_863b8f3c:

    # C "*Giggles*"
    C "*咯咯笑*"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:685
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_d6e5d8a1:

    # MC "Oh! Speaking of something for you to wear..."
    MC "哦！说到给你穿的东西……"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:686
translate schinese main18freetimecadence_bf8191bf:

    # C "Hmm?"
    C "嗯？"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:692
translate schinese m18replay_3db0fa58:

    # C "Umm..."
    C "呃……"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:695
translate schinese m18replay_860195f6:

    # C "I'm ready, master..."
    C "我准备好了，主人……"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:705
translate schinese m18replay_17f2dfdd:

    # C "I really didn't expect you to bring out something like this..."
    C "我真没想到你会拿出这种……"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:706
translate schinese m18replay_723ebd75:

    # C "Walking around in this is kind of embarrassing so..."
    C "穿着这个到处走有点羞耻，所以……"

# game/FreeTime.rpyc:707
translate schinese m18replay_7e3dca13:

    # C "I assume you have other plans in mind for me?"
    C "你对我还有别的安排吧？"

